# Diamond story 17-cycling-road-route207-vs-seeker: standalone start (--lab, or no end save from 16-bicycle-explorer-kit).
# Standard header + lab party + the cumulative state after 16-bicycle-explorer-kit, then the milestone's start.
# Names resolve through tests/gameplay/labc.py --game diamond; flag/var lines cite the script that sets them.
name GQ
gender PLAYER_GENDER_MALE
trainer-id 31415
money 20000
# Lab party: Surf alone in slot 0 (slots 1-3 cleared, so an empty Surf falls back to Struggle instead of stalling
# A-only battles); the Leppa Berry refills it once [INFERENCE: Gen 4 Leppa restores 10 PP to a move at 0 PP].
# Opponents (all optional sight trainers, Lv15-19): Route 206 trdata.json #25, #29, #26, #30, #27, #31, #28, #32, #451;
# Route 207 #34, #35, #33, #37, #36, #38.
# Staraptor carries Cut (scr_seq 0375 @0x004A MOVE_CUT, @0x005D BADGE_FOREST) and Rock Smash (@0x0141, @0x015A BADGE_COAL).
party SPECIES_EMPOLEON 60 ITEM_LEPPA_BERRY
party-move 0 0 MOVE_SURF
party-move 0 1 MOVE_NONE
party-move 0 2 MOVE_NONE
party-move 0 3 MOVE_NONE
party SPECIES_STARAPTOR 50 ITEM_NONE
party-move 1 0 MOVE_AERIAL_ACE
party-move 1 1 MOVE_ROCK_SMASH
party-move 1 2 MOVE_CUT
# @@PRIOR@@
# -- start --
warp MAP_ETERNA_ROUTE_206_GATEHOUSE 0  # (5,2), arriving from Eterna, zone_event 0079 warp 0
